 "notes": [
  "Sources: registered and voters per constituency from Table II (by commune; constituency total rows), pages 30-42; national from Table I (by province), page 29. Votes per constituency from Table IV (by commune; constituency total rows, which include ballots sent from other constituencies), pages 45-58; national from Table III, page 44. Electors from the text table in section 11 (page 25, printed page 22).",
  "Voters (Table II, 'Hela antalet röstande') equal the total ballots (valid + rejected) of Table IV in every constituency.",
  "Åland (Ahvenanmaan maakunta) has no constituency of its own; its communes belong to Turun läänin eteläinen vaalipiiri. Table III footnote: the ballots sent to Turku-Pori province from other constituencies include 4 ballots belonging to communes of Åland.",
  "Party key 'pienviljelijat' = Suomen pienviljelijäin puolue (Finnish Smallholders' Party); 'other' = Muut puolueet (other parties).",
  "Electoral alliances (Table IV footnotes): the National Progressive Party (edistys) and the Finnish Smallholders' Party had a joint electoral alliance in Turun läänin eteläinen, Turun läänin pohjoinen, Hämeen läänin eteläinen, Hämeen läänin pohjoinen and Mikkelin läänin vaalipiiri; the Agrarian Union (ml) and the National Progressive Party had a joint alliance in Vaasan läänin itäinen vaalipiiri.",
  "Mikkelin läänin vaalipiiri (Table IV footnotes): the ml figure 10 338 includes 38 votes of 2 lists left outside the electoral alliance; the pienviljelijat figure 2 240 includes 139 votes of 1 list left outside the alliance.",
